// A literal with a fractional part and the suffix `i` is a static error
// (spec/01-lexical.md, row `fractional-suffix`).
//
// A static error rejects the program: a non-zero exit status, and nothing
// runs, so nothing prints (spec/README.md, Conformance). An implementation
// that runs the program fails this probe.

print 1.5i;

// STATIC-ERROR
// STATUS: error
// COVERS: literal fractional-suffix
